    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Would you care to clarify the second example? Do you mean \"It always says Amatuka (as the byline) whether I (Amatuka-san) wrote it or not?\"",
      "html": "Would you care to clarify the second example? Do you mean \"It always says Amatuka (as the byline) whether I (Amatuka-san) wrote it or not?\"",
      "credits_raw": "Leslie",
      "content_sha256": "d4bb771aa3b1a52e96d20fabdeb380a0de9da78f22e1242be73c435c302d1385",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Yes, I believe that was what Amatsuka meant.",
      "html": "Yes, I believe that was what Amatsuka meant.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "256e10936282a83107dc8612000e3be21b84ec03dba6022f76ab5e9147fcfc67",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "を is used to mark a noun or noun phrase.\n\nN = noun.",
      "html": "を is used to mark a noun or noun phrase.<br/><br/>N = noun.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "3914a79fd4514186a0c9f217f373f0e5f1c64fecaa465493f9d5a198269a991e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "But that's not what the Geneva Convention and the Universal Copyright Conventions say. Japan and the Japanese Copyright Law follow those conventions.",
      "html": "But that's not what the Geneva Convention and the Universal Copyright Conventions say. Japan and the Japanese Copyright Law follow those conventions.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
